### AI掘金头条 新闻模块 API
### 前提：MySQL + Redis 已启动，uvicorn main:app --reload

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

# ═══ 新闻分类 ═══════════════════════════

### GET /api/news/categories — 获取所有分类（Cache-Aside，过期 7200s）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news/categories

### GET /api/news/categories?skip=0&limit=50
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news/categories?skip=0&limit=50


# ═══ 新闻列表（分页+分类过滤）═══════════

### GET /api/news/list?categoryId=1 — 缓存 Key: "news:list:1:1:10"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news/list?categoryId=1

### GET /api/news/list?categoryId=1&page=2&pageSize=5
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news/list?categoryId=1&page=2&pageSize=5

### GET /api/news/list?categoryId=999 — 空列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news/list?categoryId=999

### GET /api/news/list — 缺少必填 categoryId → 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news/list


# ═══ 新闻详情（浏览量+1 + 相关新闻5条）══

### GET /api/news/detail?id=1 — 正常查询
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news/detail?id=1

### GET /api/news/detail?id=999 — 不存在 → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news/detail?id=999

### GET /api/news/detail — 缺少 id → 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/news/detail


# ═══ 新增新闻 ═══════════════════════════

### POST /api/news/create — 正常新增
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/news/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "FastAPI 3.0 发布",
  "content": "FastAPI 3.0 带来了诸多新特性...",
  "description": "FastAPI 最新版本发布",
  "author": "官方团队",
  "category_id": 1
}

### POST /api/news/create — 缺少 content → 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/news/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "只有标题没有正文"
}
